        calc (‖iterWavePacket κ w0 ℓ x p.2‖ / (κ ^ 2 + p.2 ^ 2)) * ‖greenIterKernel κ w0 0 x p.1 * w0 p.1‖
          _ = ‖greenIterKernel κ w0 0 x p.1 * w0 p.1‖ * (‖iterWavePacket κ w0 ℓ x p.2‖ / (κ ^ 2 + p.2 ^ 2)) := by ring
